# Railway `up` upload excludes (Increment 14b). `railway up` already honours .gitignore (so node_modules
# / dist / .next / .turbo are out); these trim the upload further to what the api/web/postgres images
# actually COPY (root manifests + packages/* + apps/api + apps/web + infra/Dockerfile.postgres).
# Do NOT add packages/, apps/api, apps/web, infra/, or the root manifests here — the builds need them.
.git
apps/customer
apps/driver
apps/owner
docs
handoffs
*.md
**/*.log
